    // Deterministic bijective permutation over Z_N.
    //
    // We use the affine map  p(i) = (a * i + b) mod N  with gcd(a, N) = 1.
    // This is a bijection on [0, N). Choosing `a` coprime to N and `b` from
    // the seed gives a deterministic, seed-dependent scatter that destroys
    // 2D adjacency (consecutive i map to positions ~a apart mod N).
    //
